          "code": "def maxArea(height: list[int]) -> int:\n    l, r = 0, len(height) - 1\n    ans = 0\n    while l < r:\n        w = r - l\n        h = min(height[l], height[r])\n        ans = max(ans, w * h)\n        if height[l] < height[r]: l += 1\n        else: r -= 1\n    return ans",
